OL,3,ALego marketplace BrickLink offline
OL,4,Aafter 'unusual activity' detected
OL,5,
OL,6,F"That means containing the issue,
OL,7,Finvestigating how it happened and
OL,8,Fchecking for related issues," Lego
OL,9,Fsaid. It did not provide any further
OL,10,Fdetail about whether the site had been
OL,11,Fbreached or hacked, nor whether any
OL,12,Fcustomer data had been affected.
